<title>SPAIN: Telefonica expects placement details Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Telefonica expects placement details Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica expects the Spanish government to approve its privatisation calendar at the December 13 cabinet meeting, a spokesman for the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The placement of the state's remaining 21 percent of the telephone operator is due to take place in the first few months of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
